# ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                     VET-RATE.ORG - VA.GOV API CONFIGURATION                    ║
# ║                        COPY THIS TO .env.local                                 ║
# ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy this file to `.env.local`
# 2. Replace placeholder values with your actual credentials
# 3. Restart the dev server: npm run dev
#
# GET YOUR CREDENTIALS:
# - VA.gov OAuth: https://developer.va.gov/explore
# - Gemini AI: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# - Google Drive: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VA.GOV OAUTH 2.0 CONFIGURATION (REQUIRED FOR VA INTEGRATION DEMO)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Your VA.gov Sandbox Client ID
# Get it from: https://developer.va.gov/explore
# Click "Apply for API access" and select Authorization Code Grant (PKCE)
VITE_VA_CLIENT_ID=0oaXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

# OAuth Callback URL - Must match exactly what you registered at developer.va.gov
# For local development, use:
VITE_VA_REDIRECT_URL=http://localhost:5173/callback

# VA API Environment
# Use 'sandbox' for development/testing
# Use 'production' only after VA grants production access
VITE_VA_API_ENV=sandbox

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# VA FACILITIES API KEY (FOR VSO FINDER FACILITY SEARCH)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# This is separate from OAuth - it's an API Key
# Get it from: https://developer.va.gov/explore/api/va-facilities/sandbox-access
VITE_VA_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AI FEATURES (OPTIONAL BUT RECOMMENDED)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Google Gemini API Key for AI-powered features
# Get your free API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Free tier: 15 requests/minute, 1,500 requests/day
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSyXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# GOOGLE DRIVE BACKUP (OPTIONAL)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Google OAuth Client ID for Drive backup
# Get it from: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
VITE_GOOGLE_DRIVE_CLIENT_ID=XXXXXXXXXXXX-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OAUTH SCOPES REQUIRED FOR VA INTEGRATION DEMO
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# When registering your app at developer.va.gov, request these scopes:
#
# REQUIRED SCOPES:
#   ✓ openid                 - Required for OpenID Connect
#   ✓ profile                - Basic user profile info
#   ✓ offline_access         - Enables refresh tokens
#   ✓ claim.read             - Access to VA claims data
#   ✓ service_history.read   - Access to military service history
#   ✓ appealable_issues.read - Access to appealable decisions
#   ✓ appeals_status.read    - Access to appeals status
#
# REGISTRATION CHECKLIST:
#   □ Application Name: Vet-Rate.org
#   □ Application Type: Web Application
#   □ OAuth Grant Type: Authorization Code (PKCE)
#   □ Redirect URI: http://localhost:5173/callback
#   □ Scopes: (all listed above)
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRODUCTION CHECKLIST (WHEN READY FOR PROD ACCESS DEMO)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Before your Production Access Demo with VA:
#
#   □ Test all OAuth flows in Sandbox
#   □ Verify PKCE implementation works correctly
#   □ Test token refresh flow
#   □ Test logout/token revocation
#   □ Verify graceful handling of 401 errors
#   □ Test with all VA test users in Sandbox
#   □ Document all API endpoints you're using
#   □ Prepare demo script showing each workflow
#
